             to use the specified _d_a_t_a_s_e_t|_o_b_j_s_e_t_-_I_D as a string (dataset name)
             or a number (objset ID) when datasets have numeric names.

             If specified multiple times provides greater and greater ver‐
             bosity.

             If object IDs or object ID ranges are specified, display informa‐
             tion about those specific objects or ranges only.

             An object ID range is specified in terms of a colon-separated tu‐
             ple of the form ⟨start⟩:⟨end⟩[:⟨flags⟩].  The fields _s_t_a_r_t and
             _e_n_d are integer object identifiers that denote the upper and
